  "description": "<p data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"548\"><strong data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"202\">Waarom kiezen voor de Samsung Galaxy S23?</strong><br data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"205\">De <strong data-start=\"208\" data-end=\"230\">Samsung Galaxy S23</strong> biedt premium prestaties in een compact design. Het toestel is uitgerust met de krachtige <strong data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"362\">Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy-chipset</strong>, 8GB RAM en een helder <strong data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"424\">6,1-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X-display</strong> met 120Hz. De triple camera met 50MP hoofdsensor en verbeterde AI zorgt voor scherpe foto’s, zowel overdag als ’s nachts.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"678\">Dit exemplaar verkeert in <strong data-start=\"576\" data-end=\"610\">gebruikte maar degelijke staat</strong>, is volledig getest en wordt geleverd met <strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"675\">3 maanden garantie</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"713\">⭐ Belangrijkste pluspunten:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<li data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"765\">\r\n<p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"765\">📱 6,1-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X-display met 120Hz</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"841\">\r\n<p data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"841\">📸 Triple camera met 50MP hoofdcamera + 12MP ultra-wide + 10MP telefoto</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<p data-start=\"844\" data-end=\"889\">⚡ Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy met 8GB RAM</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"915\">💾 128GB opslagruimte</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"977\">\r\n<p data-start=\"918\" data-end=\"977\">🧼 Gebruikte maar degelijke staat en professioneel getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"979\" data-end=\"1002\">📋 Specificaties:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1036\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1036\"><strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1015\">Model:</strong> Samsung Galaxy S23</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1058\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1058\"><strong data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1050\">Opslag:</strong> 128GB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1088\"><strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1078\">Werkgeheugen:</strong> 8GB RAM</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1146\"><strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1105\">Processor:</strong> Qualcomm Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1210\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1210\"><strong data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1160\">Scherm:</strong> 6,1-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X, FHD+, 120Hz, HDR10+</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1228\"><strong data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1226\">Camera’s:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1251\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1251\">50MP hoofdcamera</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1273\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1273\">12MP ultra-wide</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1306\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1306\">10MP telefoto (3x optisch)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1330\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1330\">12MP selfiecamera</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1393\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1393\"><strong data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1352\">Connectiviteit:</strong> 5G, NFC, Bluetooth 5.3, WiFi 6E, USB-C</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1394\" data-end=\"1455\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1455\"><strong data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1409\">Batterij:</strong> 3900mAh, 25W snelladen, 15W draadloos laden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1475\"><strong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1468\">Kleur:</strong> Roze</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1508\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1508\"><strong data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1494\">Meegeleverd:</strong> Oplaadkabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1509\" data-end=\"1557\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1557\"><strong data-start=\"1511\" data-end=\"1524\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikte maar degelijke staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1559\" data-end=\"1562\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1597\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1585\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 3 maanden</p>",
